# Local dev needs no .env. With none, `npm run dev` proxies /api to the live
# public API (the accounts engine, https://accounts-api.empowered.vote/fc):
# real communities and stances, no keys.

# Running the accounts engine (ev-accounts/backend) locally? Point the dev proxy at it:
# VITE_API_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:3000

# Production has no threads yet. To design thread, reply and edit-history
# screens, turn on the synthetic demo threads (src/mocks/demoThreads.ts):
# VITE_DEMO_THREADS=1

# Production (the Render static site) sets this at build time:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://accounts-api.empowered.vote/fc
